 width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xyN0hmi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/rTI2Gj5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AZV6lTm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Yc3s8na.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iqjbhOr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/sy21BTe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/4uSaqGJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/AEX6ikk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/hK2Ne4q.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/OofG9DM.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/u6uA7Yo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/wm2UCet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Cw074li.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"36\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/2j5X6pZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/DXcKlJf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/vTsTyrz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mQgIVDu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5xXqhXe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/kVHzJV9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/cYHSkb2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GuGTe3L.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pcmP0xG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/5EiwS3H.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"40\" /><br /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\" /></p>\n\n## 📖 關於\n\n生成器控制是一個**伺服器端**模組，讓你可以透過設定檔案來配置怪物生成器方塊的各個方面。自訂生成速率、經驗值掉落、限制等等。\n\n> **⚠️ 注意：**  \n> 如果你正在使用版本 **v1.1** 並升級到 **v1.2**，請確保**刪除你的設定檔案**以避免衝突。\n\n| ![預覽1](https://imgur.com/938u6RR.gif) | ![預覽2](https://imgur.com/lUGbNIF.gif) |\n|:------------------------------------------:|:------------------------------------------:|\n\n## ⚙️ 配置選項\n\n探索並調整設定檔案中的選項以滿足你的需求：\n\n- [`ignoreRestrictions`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#ignorerestrictions)\n- [`spawnLimit`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnLimit)\n- [`spawnLimitValue`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnLimitValue)\n- [`dropXp`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXp)\n- [`dropXpValueBase`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue)\n- [`dropXpValueAdd1`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue)\n- [`dropXpValueAdd2`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue)\n- [`spawnCount`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnCount)\n- [`spawnRange`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnRange)\n- [`spawnDelay`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnDelay)\n- [`minSpawnDelay`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#minspawndelay--maxspawndelay)\n- [`maxSpawnDelay`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#minspawndelay--maxspawndelay)\n- [`playerRange`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#playerrange)\n- [`maxNearbyEntities`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#maxnearbyentities)\n- [`lootDropType`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#maxnearbyentities)\n- [`lootDropChance`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#lootdropchance)\n- [`lootDropList`](https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#lootdroplist)\n\n## ❓ 常見問題\n\n**問：** 生成器控制是客戶端還是伺服器端模組？  \n**答：** 它是伺服器端模組。\n\n**問：** 我可以將生成器控制包含在我的模組包中嗎？  \n**答：** 可以！只需正確標註模組並將其包含在相關專案中即可。",
